DexSwapModule_EstimateOutput
├── given oracle feeds are valid
│   ├── it should return oracle-expected output
│   ├── it should return target token as output token
│   └── it should scale output linearly with input
├── given oracle feeds are invalid (reverts or bad data)
│   └── it should return zero with target token
└── fuzz
    └── it should return consistent estimates for any valid amount
